charging, rollback survival, and a limiter failure (revoked/unavailable function) producing 429 on create and on 
fence; the bound on growth of `private.message_send_attempts` (budgets or a retention rule) is stated in TRACK; Phase 
4/legacy compatibility tests pass; RLS review gate recorded.
