  32: --         D4 planning decision). A statement_timeout (query_canceled, which
  33: --         an EXCEPTION WHEN OTHERS block cannot catch) still rolls the whole
  34: --         insertion back; the route answers 500 and nothing is stored.
  35: --     The limit and window come from the caller (p_insert_quota_limit,
  36: --     p_insert_quota_window_seconds; both NULL = no charge). The action name is
  37: --     fixed to 'message:create' so a Phase 4 server deployed during the
  38: --     rollout, which charges the same counter at its route for every create,
  39: --     shares one quota with this build.
