 527: comment on function public.fence_message_attempt(uuid, uuid, uuid, bigint) is
 528:   'Phase 5 T2: fence/lookup of the sender''s own client key. Returns {outcome: superseded|stored|not_stored, 
message_id (null when the stored message was deleted)}; never creates a message; makes every lower generation of the 
key unable to commit. Service role only; callers authorize the sender first.';
